00:07:26.145 --> 00:07:28.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I don't think
she knew that part.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
So as I close the door,

00:07:29.749 --> 00:07:31.617
she's like, "I just want t
experience it organically,

00:07:31.617 --> 00:07:33.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I went, "Okay, great."
And I shut it,

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:35.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I went to the --
I saw the camera crew go,

00:07:35.354 --> 00:07:37.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I don't -- I don't --"
And I was like, "Let's do it!"

00:07:37.723 --> 00:07:38.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they're like,
"Are you sure?"

00:07:38.825 --> 00:07:40.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "Did I just pu
my marriage on the line?"

00:07:40.827 --> 00:07:42.795 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then the car took off.
And I was like, "Wait!"

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:44.764 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we were rolling.
-I mean, she must be happy

00:07:44.764 --> 00:07:46.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
with the way it turned out
though, right?

00:07:46.132 --> 00:07:47.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very.
-I mean, it seems like

00:07:47.066 --> 00:07:50.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
her instincts were very good
to react to in real time.

00:07:50.069 --> 00:07:51.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
It was terrifying.

00:07:51.771 --> 00:07:53.005 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It was very, very scary.

00:07:53.005 --> 00:07:55.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
But the cool thing is,
it's a car we build

00:07:55.875 --> 00:07:58.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
