is actually a stunt driver

00:07:58.878 --> 00:08:01.113
And I remember Emily said
she turned to the guy,

00:08:01.113 --> 00:08:02.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he said, "You okay?"
and she said,

00:08:02.181 --> 00:08:05.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Well, actually, my life
is technically in your hands,"

00:08:05.418 --> 00:08:08.254
and he went, "Don't worry,
Ms. Emily -- I'm the best.

00:08:08.254 --> 00:08:11.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she went, "Okay. That
actually made me feel great.

00:08:11.691 --> 00:08:12.859 line:92%
That makes me feel really good."

00:08:12.859 --> 00:08:15.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I would say that's
every stuntman I've ever met

00:08:15.828 --> 00:08:16.395 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:16.395 --> 00:08:20.700
There's no stuntman rolls in
he's like, "I'm the 'C' choice."

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:21.300 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:24.070
-"I'll be honest with you,
Ms. Emily, I am mediocre."

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:25.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
"Wait. What?"

00:08:25.404 --> 00:08:28.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"A few guys fell out
for me to get this job."

00:08:28.508 --> 00:08:30.042 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:30.042 --> 00:08:31.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I blew it.
I had my meeting with John

00:08:31.777 --> 00:08:33.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
Blew it pretty hard.
-"I'll be honest.

00:08:33.613 --> 00:08:36.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just arrived
on that there bus, so..."

00:08:36.449 --> 00:08:37.717 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:37.717 --> 00:08:40.853 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But it really is --
I think it is a lovely bookend

00:08:40.853 --> 00:08:44.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I want to congratulate you
for staying the course.

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
This is a lovely bookend.

00:08:46.158 --> 00:08:48.995 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's so nice to see you.
-It is.

00:08:48.995 --> 00:08:52.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Congrats, by the way,
since the time I was suppose

00:08:52.064 --> 00:08:54.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
to see you, that you canceled,
and then now,

00:08:54.767 --> 00:08:58.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
congrats again on doing "SNL."
-Thank very much.

00:08:58.004 --> 00:09:01.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
That is a life goal
of all life goals.

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:02.408 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And it was amazing

00:09:02.408 --> 00:09:03.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
