00:09:05.077 --> 00:09:07.213
I was like, "This is amazing!"
There was actually something

00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:10.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
really special about doing i
during that whole time.

00:09:10.716 --> 00:09:13.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was amazing
to watch the show

00:09:13.185 --> 00:09:14.086 line:92%
