00:09:14.086 --> 00:09:15.421 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it was really nice
to see you do it.

00:09:15.421 --> 00:09:16.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, buddy, thank you so muc
for being here.

00:09:16.856 --> 00:09:17.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Absolutely.
So good to see you.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.592 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We're gonna touch again!
Human hands!

00:09:19.592 --> 00:09:21.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
